W standard_natural_vectors%s  standard_natural_vectors.ads  standard_natural_vectors.ali
W straightening_syzygies%s  straightening_syzygies.adb  straightening_syzygies.ali
Z system.secondary_stack%s  s-secsta.adb	s-secsta.ali

U sagbi_homotopies%s	sagbi_homotopies.ads	b31ac1cd EE NE OO PK
W standard_complex_matrices%s  standard_complex_matrices.ads  standard_complex_matrices.ali
W standard_complex_polynomials%s  standard_complex_polynomials.ads  standard_complex_polynomials.ali
